    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Raysance/EdgeSwipe/zipball/v0.5.0",
    "body": "## What's New\n- Add Switch Window action for focusing a specific selected window.\n- Add a Switch Window submenu in Settings that lists currently visible windows.\n- Show the selected window thumbnail in Gesture Preview when configuring Switch Window.\n- Extend Grant Permissions to request both Accessibility and Screen Recording permissions.\n\n## Notes\n- Switch Window requires Accessibility permission to focus the selected window.\n- Window thumbnails require Screen Recording permission.\n- The app bundle is attached as EdgeSwipe-v0.5.0.zip."
  },
