    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Raysance/EdgeSwipe/zipball/v0.4.0",
    "body": "## What's New\n- Add Hide Front Window action for quickly hiding the frontmost app window on the active display.\n- Add Restore Hidden Window action to bring back the last window hidden by EdgeSwipe.\n- Add a Settings shortcut for requesting Accessibility permission and opening the macOS Accessibility privacy pane.\n- Save the current gesture mappings and recognition thresholds as the new default configuration.\n\n## Notes\n- Hide/restore window actions require macOS Accessibility permission.\n- The app bundle is attached as EdgeSwipe-v0.4.0.zip."
  },
