    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Raysance/EdgeSwipe/zipball/v0.3.0",
    "body": "Changes:\n- Add one-finger corner swipe triggers for all four trackpad corners.\n- Split recognition parameters into independent edge and corner slider groups.\n- Move recognition sliders and Live Probe into a separate parameters window.\n- Add a main-window gesture preview with clickable gesture labels.\n- Make the preview result animation reflect the selected action more directly.\n\nValidation:\n- swift build\n- swift run EdgeSwipeCheck\n- scripts/build-app.sh\n- plutil -lint outputs/EdgeSwipe.app/Contents/Info.plist\n- codesign --verify --deep --strict outputs/EdgeSwipe.app\n\nSHA-256: ba08e660bab26fe8449db9246762e0af5b4087a186f715bb8c66623431aed38c"
  },
